http://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9799919799
.TP
http://tiswww.case.edu/\*~chet/bash/POSIX \(em شرحی درباره حالت posix
.TP
\fIsh\fP(1), \fIksh\fP(1), \fIcsh\fP(1)
.TP
